。\n         </span>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 0em;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n          几年后，Paul的小咖啡车慢慢变成了大型的咖啡店并开始自己进行烘焙，这也让他有机会开始接触原产地，他来到哥伦比亚寻豆，一下子就爱上了这片土地，整理了美国的事业之后，举家搬迁到哥伦比亚，开始进行以瑰夏为主要品种的咖啡种植。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 0em;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RhFZEHrtTfw2oiaXtZkia4VFYWs0QhOVdd1LV8D6QIOnloeJlkhqt39BgHZdtml4tQJZBHkOW8eyicg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.6em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-decoration: none solid rgb(51, 51, 51);\">\n          2019年，米卡瓦凭借一只二氧化碳浸渍日晒的瑰夏获得了哥伦比亚当年卓越杯的第一名，并创了历史最高分92.71分的记录。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.6em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-decoration: none solid rgb(51, 51, 51);\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: left;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<strong style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n           处理细节\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 0em;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n          这个批次的鲜果在采摘洗净后装入桶内，打入二氧化碳，在压力环境下进行6天的CM二氧化碳浸渍发酵，之后倒出在晾晒架上进行缓慢干燥，直到被晾干到含水率为12%，之后带壳在通风良好的仓库中静置足够长的时间，使风味趋向稳定。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.6em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-decoration: none solid rgb(51, 51, 51);\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RhFZEHrtTfw2oiaXtZkia4VFdNtOIYSW3ibOYeBzpFpgD5n0PC0Xozw8wiaPw1ic7hDvjibicDoyoKxMWNw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: left;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<strong style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n           获奖情况\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 0em;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n          2019年哥伦比亚COE卓越杯第一名。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 0em;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n          2021年李金龙使用Mikava瑰夏取得WBrC中国冲煮亚军。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 0em;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n          2021年姚子鹏使用Mikava瑰夏取得WBrC香港冲煮亚军。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 0em;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n          2021年畠山大輝使用Mikava瑰夏拼Takesi瑰夏取得WBrC世界冲煮亚军。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 0em;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n          2022年小野光使用Mikava瑰夏取得WBrC日本冲煮冠军。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 0em;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n          2022年徐诗媛使用Mikava瑰夏取得WBrC世界冲煮冠军。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">